      "comment": "THE LADYBIRD NZ (11) had a win at this track on November 10 when sent out as the $2.40 favourite before making up plenty of ground but finding a couple better at her latest appearance over 1690m at Shepparton. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. This doesn't look as hard so she is sure to prove tough to beat. THE IRISHMAN NZ (8) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 8 metres from the winner in third over 1780m at Mt Gambier after having a tough run when racing outside the leader for the entire trip. Drawn to enjoy a nice run, with luck possibly playing a role at some point. Has the class to find the winners' list. DIAMOND KRUSHER (5) disappointed last time when seventh over 2190m at this track. She has won all of her six career victories at this track and can bounce back. WATCHING OVER US (6) is the best of the rest after finishing fifth over 2190m at this track last time out after he led at the bell.",
